":"To the 5 aztecs whom were Alara, Udaka, and many more.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:09:56.087Z"},{"id":"ao6adUJqDdeAMFV790yP","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"Ye Yint Lwin","userId":"13853615692537432416","questionIndex":10,"answerContent":"He saw that the Udaka and Alara had passed away so he went to teach his sermon to 5 other disciples","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:52:01.805Z"},{"id":"elOiYnWSHgembaaMPya3","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"Ye Yint Lwin","userId":"13853615692537432416","questionIndex":15,"answerContent":"The Birth of the Prince Siddatharatha","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:19:19.589Z"},{"id":"nk6VaMuuf2SXHezP0ihc","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"hein min","userId":"12623801953711947772","questionIndex":2,"answerContent":"calm and peace","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-26T21:42:41.450Z"},{"id":"nmyVufDIBWrtfCyWim6X","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"Ye Yint Lwin","userId":"13853615692537432416","questionIndex":16,"answerContent":"The first encounter between the prince and mana","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:19:41.795Z"},{"id":"oaXnebT16SJDVeWFkMLY","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"Ye Yint Lwin","userId":"13853615692537432416","questionIndex":1,"answerContent":"I learned that the Buddha was born in the Lumbini gardens and as a child, he was a very talented archer. At the age of 29, after seeing the 4 signs of suffering, he went into the forest and became a monk. Then he tried 2 different ways of finding enlightenment; the high way and the low way. The thought that if he took the low way and ate very little food for 6 years, he would become the Buddha. However after doing both ways, he found out that doing the middle path was the best option and later he became the Buddha.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-03T00:09:54.603Z"},{"id":"poxlWqeHqVdMQSw7XBjJ","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"hein min","userId":"12623801953711947772","questionIndex":4,"answerContent":"two merchant brothers","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-26T21:50:10.359Z"},{"id":"tyWQdV59WsWAv5l32cnn","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"Ye Yint Lwin","userId":"13853615692537432416","questionIndex":9,"answerContent":"The Sangha who help spread and preach the teachings of the Buddha","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:47:33.893Z"},{"id":"u9nIK0JvFg77dVXm8ZFA","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"hein min","userId":"12623801953711947772","questionIndex":3,"answerContent":"khunnit yet nnit mar, kya-pan pin paw po mhar tine hlight teh","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-26T21:49:23.691Z"},{"id":"vcgVgLNJmpGySxtQJF0g","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"Ye Yint Lwin","userId":"13853615692537432416","questionIndex":8,"answerContent":"He thought of preaching his sermon to Alara and Udaka first but then decided to preach it to all of the disciples at the same time","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:45:36.409Z"},{"id":"wlOdIe32uZrUHh9i7hGU","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"hein min","userId":"12623801953711947772","questionIndex":7,"answerContent":"yes they did because the buddha wanted to share his metta","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-26T22:00:23.974Z"},{"id":"wwuvqzQsuzNWT2Cdhq2G","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"Ye Yint Lwin","userId":"13853615692537432416","questionIndex":19,"answerContent":"The battle between mana and the Buddha","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:23:07.112Z"},{"id":"yJNVpKTWT3tyTHnBWqya","lessonId":"Ol5Hh89d6iBLdRAqDLUC","studentName":"hein min","userId":"12623801953711947772","questionIndex":6,"answerContent":"to be sangha","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-06-26T21:56:57.219Z"}]}